# BloodLink Production Release Signing Template
# To build a signed release bundle (AAB) or APK:
# 1. Generate your release keystore:
#    keytool -genkey -v -keystore release-keystore.jks -alias bloodlink-release -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
# 2. Place release-keystore.jks in the android-app/app directory (or specify absolute path below)
# 3. Add these properties to your global or local gradle.properties:
#
# KEYSTORE_FILE=release-keystore.jks
# KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=your_store_password_here
# KEY_ALIAS=bloodlink-release
# KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password_here
#
# 4. Run: ./gradlew bundleRelease (for Google Play AAB) or ./gradlew assembleRelease (for Release APK)
